[en.FOCUS_C12_INCORPORATE_INTO_UNICORN]
Incorporate into Unicorn

[en.FOCUS_C12_INCORPORATE_INTO_UNICORN_desc]
Although the farm’s soldiers are still mainly composed of a large number of local earth ponies, as the battlefield situation grows tense, we can consider enlisting some unicorns into our ranks, ensuring that we are not left completely helpless when facing enemy magical attacks.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_INCORPORATE_INTO_UNICORN]
编入独角兽

[zh.FOCUS_C12_INCORPORATE_INTO_UNICORN_desc]
虽然农场的士兵仍然是以当地大量的陆马为主，但是随着战场局势的吃紧，我们仍然可以考虑让一些独角兽加入我们的部队，好让我们面对敌方的魔法攻击时不至于毫无办法。

